I am Anthea...{VAR BE01}
Trainer. Before you go to confront my
lord N, please take a moment to rest...{VAR BE01}

Ah, good. Both you and your Pokémon
regained energy...{VAR BE01}
Trainers battle to practice their skills
and to grow in experience, but never{VAR BE00}
to hurt their Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
My lord N has realized this, deep down in
his heart...but he has spent too much{VAR BE00}
painful time here in this castle to{VAR BE00}
admit it...

I am Concordia.
I give peace and comfort to N.{VAR BE01}
N has been separated from people
since he was young. He was brought up{VAR BE00}
with Pokémon...{VAR BE01}
Pokémon that were betrayed, mistreated
and hurt by bad people...{VAR BE01}
Ghetsis deliberately brought only those
poor Pokémon closer to N.{VAR BE01}
N was touched by their plight, and
started pursuing the truth,{VAR BE00}
thinking only of Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
N's heart is pure and innocent.{VAR BE01}
But there is nothing more beautiful
and terrifying than innocence.

